OL,3,GNEWSAThe M25 at 40: Raves, Batman and
OL,4,Agive peas a chance
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith raves, Batman and mysterious
OL,7,Fgraffiti celebrating vegetables, the
OL,8,FM25 has seen more than its share of
OL,9,Funusual activity since its final
OL,10,Fstretch opened near St Albans,
OL,11,FHertfordshire, 40 years ago.
OL,13,FSince Margaret Thatcher officially
OL,14,Fdeclared the motorway fully open on 29
OL,15,FOctober 1986, the orbital road has
OL,16,Finspired hit songs, protests and coach
OL,17,Ftours.
OL,19,FHere are five of the strangest stories
OL,20,Ffrom the motorway that circles London.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
